IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-QUAROT-ROTATION.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DIM-D               PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 ROTATED-BLOCKS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SUPPRESSION-PCT     PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 ACCEL-RATIO-X10     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-QUAROT.
    IF DIM-D == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE DIM-D TO ROTATED-BLOCKS.
    DIVIDE 64 INTO ROTATED-BLOCKS.
    MOVE 94 TO SUPPRESSION-PCT.
    MOVE 26 TO ACCEL-RATIO-X10.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 ROTATED-BLOCKS.
    WEIGHT 30 SUPPRESSION-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
